🖥 Kompyuter grafikasi: Yo'nalishlar va dasturlar

ℹ️ Kompyuter grafikasi sohasida qaysi yo’nalish qanday dasturni talab qilinadi:

📌 Grafik dizayner - Adobe Illustrator, Adobe Photoshop, Corel Draw;

📌 UI/UX dizayner - Figma, Sketch, Adobe XD; Adobe Illustrator, Adobe Photoshop;

📌 Motion dizayner - Adobe Illustrator, Adobe Photoshop, Adobe After Effect, 4D cinema;

📌 3D animator - Adobe After Effect, 3D Max, Blender, Maya;

📌 Sculpture/Modeling dizayner - Zbrush, Autodesk Maya, Autodesk 3dMax, Blender;

